        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Emily Bergl, Jeff Daniels, Molly Price\n- Works: Shameless, Chasing Sleep, Men in Trees, Desperate Housewives, Southland, Sweet and Lowdown, Not Fade Away\n- Organizations: ABC, TNT, Showtime\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles\n\nFacts:\n- Emily Bergl is best known for her role as Rachel Lang in a 1999 supernatural horror film.\n- Molly Price co-starred in the 1999 film Sweet and Lowdown.\n- Chasing Sleep is a 2000 film starring Jeff Daniels and Emily Bergl.\n- Molly Price co-starred in the 2000 film Chasing Sleep.\n- Emily Bergl played Annie O'Donnell on the ABC television show Men in Trees from 2006 to 2008.\n- Emily Bergl played Tammi Bryant on the TNT drama series Southland from 2009 to 2013.\n- Emily Bergl played Beth Young on Desperate Housewives from 2010 to 2011.\n- Molly Price co-starred in the 2012 film Not Fade Away.\n- Emily Bergl played Sammi Slott in Shameless from 2014 to 2015.\n- Shameless is an American comedy-drama television series that airs on Showtime.\n- Shameless is set in Chicago and filmed in Los Angeles, with exterior scenes shot in Chicago.",
